participant Analyst "Analyst" actor
participant Agent "AI Agent"
participant DNS "DoH Resolver"
participant TI "Threat Intel DB"
msg Analyst -> Agent solid filled #1 "Request IP attribution"
msg Agent -> DNS solid filled #2 "Query PTR record"
msg DNS -> Agent dotted filled #3 "Return hostname"
msg Agent -> TI solid filled #4 "Query reputation and ASN"
msg TI -> Agent dotted filled #5 "Return score and category"
msg Agent -> Analyst solid filled #6 "Present structured report"
